{"title":"1957 AHSME Problems/Problem 28","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> are positive and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/4/ea4773d7c73d0b4e745d16de8482ce5539688e83.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\not= 1,\\,b\\not= 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"94\" height=\"17\" />, then the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/2/8823eb4466e924b85d4f4d3dae18fb6c2f910fe6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^{\\log_b{a}}$\" width=\"40\" height=\"15\" /> is: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/e/53e24229df34a7bc226f7a7edcf24af04fd4013c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{dependent upon }{b} \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{dependent upon }{a}\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{dependent upon }{a}\\text{ and }{b}\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{zero}\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{one}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"797\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By the fact that logarithms are the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Inverse_of_a_function\" title=\"Inverse of a function\">inverse</a> of exponentiation, it is clear that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/f/05f0c5014bafa459599ac1b03c6b7d55f0ea1efa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^{log_b{a}}=a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"75\" height=\"17\" />, so our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/b/fabc9a2c07386ad8217b242155fb01659f98d484.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\text{ dependent upon }a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"179\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME\" title=\"1957 AHSME\">1957 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1957 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1957 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1957\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1957 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">Problem 27</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title